OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FTwo police officers are under
OL,8,Finvestigation by the policing watchdog
OL,9,Ffor misconduct after serial sex
OL,10,Foffender Simon Levy was left free to
OL,11,Fmurder two women and rape a third.
OL,13,FLevy's crime spree spanned from 2018
OL,14,Fto 2025, and included a myriad of sex
OL,15,Fattacks on women in public spaces and
OL,16,Ftwo killings, as the Metropolitan
OL,17,FPolice, the British Transport Police
OL,18,F(BTP) and the courts failed to stop
OL,19,Fhim.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
