CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FOn Friday, he was found guilty of
OL,8,Fmurdering Carmenza Valencia-Trujillo,
OL,9,F53, in March last year, and Sheryl
OL,10,FWilkins, 39, in August last year, and
OL,11,Fcarrying out a violent sex attack
OL,12,Fagainst a third woman in January 2025.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
