CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FThe Met, BTP and Crown Prosecution
OL,8,FService have all admitted failings in
OL,9,Fhow they dealt with Levy, who was on
OL,10,Fbail as his attacks on women escalated
OL,11,Fto murder.
OL,13,FDeputy Assistant Commissioner Kevin
OL,14,FSouthworth, from the Met, said
OL,15,Ffailures to remand Levy in custody at
OL,16,Fhearings at Highbury Corner
OL,17,FMagistrates' Court in May and June
OL,18,F2025 had left him free to kill a
OL,19,Fsecond time.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
