CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,8,FConduct (IOPC) said on Friday that an
OL,9,Finvestigation into alleged failures of
OL,10,FMet Police officers in their
OL,11,Fmanagement of Levy was "ongoing".
OL,13,FThe watchdog added that its
OL,14,Finvestigation began in January
OL,15,Ffollowing a voluntary conduct referral
OL,16,Ffrom the force, relating to alleged
OL,17,Ffailures by two officers following
OL,18,FLevy's prison release on licence in
OL,19,FFebruary 2023.
OL,26,@sD@XOUsD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FThe IOPC said it was "investigating
OL,8,Fthe management of Simon Levy from his
OL,9,Ffirst conviction in September 2021 up
OL,10,Fto his arrest in September 2025".
OL,12,FAn IOPC spokesperson said: "We are
OL,13,Fexamining whether action could or
OL,14,Fshould have been taken to prevent his
OL,15,Freoffending, and if all officers
OL,16,Finvolved in his management followed
OL,17,Fpolicies, procedures and training.
OL,26,@oD@VOUrD@`O]tD@\OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,F"We are also assessing whether any
OL,8,Flearning, whether individual, force-
OL,9,Fwide, or nationally, or other changes
OL,10,Fshould be implemented in light of the
OL,11,Fevents under investigation.
OL,13,F"At this stage, we have served a gross
OL,14,Fmisconduct notice on a police
OL,15,Fconstable and a misconduct notice on a
OL,16,Fdetective sergeant, which means that
OL,17,Fthe actions of those officers are
OL,18,Funder investigation.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
