PN,30807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,F"The serving of conduct notices does
OL,8,Fnot necessarily mean disciplinary
OL,9,Fproceedings will follow."
OL,11,FLevy's crime spree began when he
OL,12,Fsexually assaulted two women in 2018,
OL,13,Fand a prison guard while he was behind
OL,14,Fbars in 2022.
OL,16,FAfter his release, he groped a woman
OL,17,Fon the Tube in October 2023, and
OL,18,Fallegedly raped another in May 2024,
OL,19,Ffor which he was recalled to prison
OL,20,Fand released again in August that year.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
