OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FIn November 2024 he was arrested for
OL,8,Ffour sexual assaults on the Tube, for
OL,9,Fwhich he has since been separately
OL,10,Fconvicted, but delays in organising an
OL,11,Fidentification parade left him a free
OL,12,Fman.
OL,14,FHe then sexually assaulted six more
OL,15,Fwomen on the Tube ` one in March,
OL,16,Fthree in April and two in May 2025.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
