PN,30809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FThe woman who survived the rape for
OL,8,Fwhich Levy was convicted on Friday,
OL,9,Fwas attacked in January 2025, but
OL,10,Fpolice were unable to follow up on her
OL,11,Fallegations until after he had killed
OL,12,FMs Valencia-Trujillo in March, and Ms
OL,13,FWilkins in August.
OL,15,FWhen the woman reported attack, she
OL,16,Fwas instead taken into custody for
OL,17,Fbreaching a community order.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
