OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FPolice said they had struggled to
OL,8,Fspeak to the victim because she gave
OL,9,Fthe wrong date at one point, there was
OL,10,Fa lack of CCTV at the site, and she
OL,11,Fwas not easily contactable because she
OL,12,Fwas homeless.
OL,14,FLevy's victims' families joined a
OL,15,Fsenior officer outside of the Old
OL,16,FBailey after the trial, as he urged
OL,17,Fany more survivors of the "dangerous"
OL,18,Fserial sex offender to come forward.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
