PN,30811
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FDetective Chief Inspector Neil John,
OL,8,Fwho led the Metropolitan Police
OL,9,Finvestigation into Levy, said the
OL,10,Fvictims' families had demonstrated
OL,11,F"incredible dignity and remarkable
OL,12,Fresolve" throughout the trial.
OL,14,FFlanked by Ms Wilkins' two sisters and
OL,15,FMs Valencia-Trujillo's daughter, he
OL,16,Fsaid: "Both Carmenza Trujillo and
OL,17,FSheryl Wilkins were much-loved women.
OL,18,FThey were daughters, sisters, friends
OL,19,Fand their loss is felt by all those
OL,20,Fwho knew them."
OL,26,@sD@AOUtD@HO]xD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30812
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FHe also said the surviving victim, who
OL,8,Fcannot be identified, had shown
OL,9,F"commendable bravery" as she presented
OL,10,F"vital evidence" in court.
OL,12,FDCI John said: "Her testimony was
OL,13,Fcrucial in ensuring that Levy will now
OL,14,Fspend most, if not all, of his life in
OL,15,Fprison.
OL,17,F"While we cannot undo the actions of
OL,18,FSimon Levy, I hope today's conviction
OL,19,Fprovides a sense of justice and
OL,20,Fclosure for those affected."
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@UO]rD@AOUrD@PO]tD@POUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
