OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,FDCI John said the investigation had
OL,8,Fbeen "complex and challenging", and
OL,9,Fthe evidence uncovered "proved a
OL,10,Fpattern of behaviour which was
OL,11,Fsexually motivated and exhibited
OL,12,Fwillingness to escalate violence for
OL,13,F(Levy's) own gratification".
OL,26,@pD@FOUpD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
