OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,F"Although we are proud of the work
OL,8,Fthat has gone into securing this
OL,9,Fverdict, we remain relentless in
OL,10,Fpursuing offenders who perpetrate
OL,11,Fviolence against women and girls and
OL,12,Fare appealing to anyone who is yet to
OL,13,Freport offences relating to Levy to
OL,14,Fcome forward," he said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
