OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786213111
OL,3,CTwo police officers under
OL,4,Cinvestigation after Simon Levy left
OL,5,Cfree to kill
OL,7,F"Reporting rape or sexual assault is
OL,8,Fdaunting ` many victim-survivors will
OL,9,Fhave concerns about speaking to the
OL,10,Fpolice ` but we want to be clear that
OL,11,Four priority is their safety and we
OL,12,Fcontinue to work with partners across
OL,13,FLondon to raise awareness of the
OL,14,Fsupport we can provide."
